# Twenty cycles of a movie's life on the tone movie (its sound open each time) (cavekit-flash.md R10, T-580): navigated away (about:blank), back, reloaded,
# the card closed and the page opened in a new one; after each, at most one plugin-container of this shell and none
# stopped. The daemon's resident memory is marked after the first cycle and read after the last (10 MB at most more);
# the last card closed, the player must be gone 35 s on (the engine keeps it 30 s after its last movie): no orphan.
id: flash-life-cycles-tone
section: Flash
item: Twenty cycles of navigating away, back, reload and closing the card on the tone movie (its sound open each time): never a second plugin-container nor a wedged one, the daemon's memory within 10 MB of cycle 1's, and no plugin-container left 35 s after the last card
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-tone.html
kit: cavekit-flash.md R10
wait rect 'sel:embed' 40
launch about:blank
chrome back
wait rect 'sel:embed' 30
chrome reload
wait rect 'sel:embed' 30
card-close
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-tone.html 60
wait rect 'sel:embed' 40
expect plugins 1
rss-mark
launch about:blank
chrome back
wait rect 'sel:embed' 30
